      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Logs + queues: opaque IDs and safe metadata only.\nCaches, scratch files, exports and indexes follow the same policy.\nAudit and cost records stay minimal; private text stays separate.",
